  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "XA01101",
    "sub_id": "97240",
    "scr_dup": "003",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>平時成績包括：上課表現 上課出席狀況 作業 參與討論區活動 課程回饋 :40%</div>\n\n<div>期中報告：用日文介紹喜好，自己想去的景點等創意主題：30%</div>\n\n<div>期末報告：用日文介紹過去的經驗以及將來的夢想等創意主題：30%</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1. 請準時上課。\n2. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。\n3. 學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因\n4. 期末發表因重大事件無法到課發表，需在發表當日時間之前告知，並附相關證明，才有辦法安排補考\n5.平時成績需要平時的努力不得在期末之後要求無條件更改分數 \n6.不接受日文程度高過N2以上同學或是曾住過日本一年以上的同學修習",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1. Be on time. 請準時上課。<br />\n2. Participate in the class discussion and class activities. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。<br />\n3. Students must submit a leave application to the school in advance, stating the reason for the leave and the expected duration.學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因和預計時間。<br />\n4.Following the FCU Exam Regulations, cheaters will receive ZERO for their exams and such cases will be reviewed by the Student Reward and Disciplinary Committee. 考試請遵照考場規定，若作弊者以0分計算</div>\n\n<div>5&quot;Unless there is a major event such as illness, no make-up exams will be given for missed midterms or finals. Grades for coursework require consistent effort throughout the term, and requests for unconditional grade changes after the final exam will not be accepted.&quot;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>期中期末若非生病等重大事件，缺考不給予補考。平時成績需要平時的努力不得在期末之後要求無條件更改分數&nbsp;</div>\n<br />\n&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
